  "sourceTitle": "Easy Baked Chicken Recipe",
  "sourceText": "Easy Baked Chicken Recipe\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 4, 2009 - 1:08am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n5 whole chicken breasts, halved, boned\nskinned\n1 (8 oz.) Kraft French Dressing\n1 can whole berries cranberry sauce\n1 pkg. Lipton onion soup mix\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Place chicken breasts in baking dish. Combine remaining ingredients and spread over chicken. Bake 1 hour at 350 degrees. Serve over rice.",
